## Why This Design Is Safe

This design avoids the most common problems.

* it does **not** let the UI send raw SQL
* it validates table/column names against real DB metadata
* it uses `PreparedStatement`
* it enforces max page size
* it adds query timeout
* it supports only read-oriented `SELECT` behavior

