## Important Production Improvement: Prevent Duplicate Metadata Indexing

Right now, every discovery inserts new metadata documents.

A better ID would be:

    connectionId + ":" + schema + ":" + table + ":" + column

For example:

    doc.setId(connectionId + ":" + schema + ":" + table.getTableName() + ":" + column.getName());

That makes re-discovery overwrite existing metadata instead of duplicating it.

